Z||000002||Jefrysuko||12-13-2001||12:18 AM||||Look at the white car at the top of the page.  If the grey lower portion is what you are referring to as "ground effects," they come on these models of cars.<P>84 Indy<BR>85 GT<BR>86-7 SE<BR>86-88 GT<P>The price is that which you pay for the car.  For pictures look around the forum you will find many.  If you are looking for some type of aftermarket add-on their are some chin spoilers that attach to the front bumper but that is about all I have ever seen.  ||||reg||1
